  "goodToKnow": "Glühend means glowing or red-hot: glühende Kohlen, glühend heiß, and figuratively ardent or passionate: ein glühender Verehrer, glühender Hass. Glühen means to glow, as in der Glühwein (mulled wine, a Christmas market staple) and die Glühbirne (light bulb). Auf glühenden Kohlen sitzen means to be on tenterhooks."
